1
00:00:20,816 --> 00:00:22,656
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:43,584
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,696 --> 00:00:46,624
=Episode 19=

4
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:52,479
(Ke isn't feeling well.)

5
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:53,439
(Come here.)

6
00:00:59,039 --> 00:01:01,039
(Me and Su Qinglan? And Zhang Yongren?)

7
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,479
(How is that possible?)

8
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,480
(Zhang Haotian must have made it up)

9
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:06,480
(to keep me by his side.)

10
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:25,280
If you keep staring at me like that,

11
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,239
I'll leave.

12
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,439
For those three years,

13
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,920
my adoptive father would make
two trips every year

14
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,959
to see Su Qinglan.

15
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:38,040
He only wanted to tell her
that he had never betrayed her.

16
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,920
Even in his final moments,
he was still calling her name.

17
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,920
But Su Qinglan never agreed to see him,
not even once.

18
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,439
I never told Su Qinglan any of this.

19
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,400
Because she didn't deserve to know.

20
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:56,519
She deserves nothing but hell.

21
00:01:58,719 --> 00:01:59,519
So,

22
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,000
her death wasn't an accident,

23
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,640
was it?

24
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:03,280
Who knows?

25
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:14,879
You may not believe this,

26
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:18,199
but just looking at you

27
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:21,039
already makes me feel happy.

28
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,919
It's like

29
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:25,639
I finally have a home.

30
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,879
I'll divorce Lin Lulu when I get back.

31
00:02:35,199 --> 00:02:36,599
Then we'll leave everything behind.

32
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,120
Haotian.

33
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,199
Have Ke examined.

34
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,360
No need.

35
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,879
I don't feel

36
00:02:57,439 --> 00:02:58,680
uncomfortable anymore.

37
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,599
Haotian.

38
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,280
I just came back from the funeral home.

39
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,400
The funeral home?

40
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,280
Why did you go there?

41
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,319
About Jiang Lai's cremation...

42
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,199
Didn't I already tell you?

43
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:15,800
She's not Jiang Lai.

44
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,000
She's Zhao Ke.

45
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,199
You're just scaring yourself. Leave.

46
00:03:19,719 --> 00:03:20,759
No, listen to me.

47
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:22,879
Something is really wrong with her.

48
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:23,719
Leave.

49
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:26,520
Haotian.

50
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,520
Alright, take care.

51
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,000
I'm telling you, believe me.

52
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,759
I really investigated this.

53
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:34,360
Come on.

54
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:35,439
Your investigation?

55
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,599
I shouldn't have let you come here.

56
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:43,560
(Is she Jiang Lai or Zhao Ke?)

57
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:47,159
(I just need to check
if she has two kidneys or not.)

58
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:56,199
Lulu.

59
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,479
Baby.

60
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,000
Lulu.

61
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,920
(How ironic.)

62
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,319
(Back then, this safe)

63
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,240
(held the document)

64
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:26,920
(that kept me from turning
my life around.)

65
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:29,079
(Now that Su Qinglan is dead,)

66
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:31,160
(the agreement has been voided.)

67
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:33,920
(Now it just sits here wide open.)

68
00:04:37,900 --> 00:04:39,720
(Trust Fund Agreement)

69
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:42,480
Ms. Su, you want to set up a trust fund?

70
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,319
I'm counting on you, Mr. Zhou.

71
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,839
If anything happens to me,

72
00:04:48,839 --> 00:04:52,160
all my assets shall be placed
into a trust fund

73
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,120
and transferred to my daughter,
Lin Lulu,

74
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,920
over the course of thirty years.

75
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:58,000
Furthermore, I want to prevent
any possibility

76
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,720
of Zhang Haotian persuading Lin Lulu

77
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:03,800
to terminate this trust.

78
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:06,000
Not a single penny shall go to him.

79
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,000
(All assets of Party A transfer
to Lin Lulu within 30 years.)

80
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,040
I've actually never understood

81
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:12,439
why you agreed to this marriage.

82
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,959
She was making such a fuss back then.

83
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,519
I just casually made that request.

84
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:21,279
I never expected Zhang Haotian
would actually do it.

85
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,959
(I endured for so long,)

86
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:24,920
(Thinking once Su Qinglan died,)

87
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,720
(I could divorce, split the assets,)

88
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,720
(and leave with Zhao Ke.)

89
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:31,680
(But now there's a trust fund.)

90
00:05:31,879 --> 00:05:34,000
(Su Qinglan, you're ruthless.)

91
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:36,040
(You didn't leave me a single penny.)

92
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,519
(No way.)

93
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,759
(I cannot divorce yet.)

94
00:05:48,759 --> 00:05:51,319
(Ms. Zhao, I found something else
during the investigation.)

95
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:52,600
Tell me.

96
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,639
(I found Ms. Shen from Xingyao)

97
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:55,720
(and Ms. Huang from Tengfei)

98
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,720
(have had extensive financial dealings
with Zhang Haotian.)

99
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:58,480
(But)

100
00:05:58,519 --> 00:06:00,480
(Zhang Haotian only has one
shell company under his name.)

101
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,759
That means

102
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:04,079
Zhang Haotian may be suspected of fraud.

103
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,800
Hello? Who is this?

104
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,120
Want to play a game with me?

105
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,160
What kind of game?

106
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:17,480
Who are you?

107
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:19,399
I don't have time for your prank.

108
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:21,160
You invested 30 million

109
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,480
in Zhang Haotian.

110
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,959
How do you know that?

111
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,519
You invested 80 million

112
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,000
in Zhang Haotian.

113
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,120
Who are you?

114
00:06:28,279 --> 00:06:30,279
You invested 100 million
in Zhang Haotian.

115
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:33,279
The eighth of every month

116
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,519
is your agreed profit payout date.

117
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,120
Tell him

118
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,079
you want your returns

119
00:06:39,319 --> 00:06:40,519
and your principal back.

120
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,360
Who are you to order me around?

121
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:44,000
Why should I listen to you?

122
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,040
Zhang Haotian has Su Qinglan
backing him.

123
00:06:46,439 --> 00:06:48,319
Besides, the returns are stable now.

124
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,959
I have no reason to withdraw.

125
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:05,399
Zhang Haotian tricked that woman
into giving up her kidney

126
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,720
and is now trying to destroy
her completely.

127
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,120
You still dare to trust

128
00:07:09,519 --> 00:07:10,639
someone like him?

129
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:18,199
(Jiang Lai)
(I'm leaving for days. Don't worry.)

130
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:19,920
Jiang Lai

131
00:07:20,759 --> 00:07:22,279
must have gone to find Zhang Haotian.

132
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,360
(Broken Dreams)

133
00:07:30,992 --> 00:07:35,890
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

134
00:07:36,176 --> 00:07:39,590
♪I should forget you♪

135
00:07:39,672 --> 00:07:44,520
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

136
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,664
♪To carry on♪

137
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:52,152
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

138
00:07:52,216 --> 00:07:54,630
♪You no longer have the strength♪

139
00:07:56,144 --> 00:07:59,160
♪You want me to go there for you♪

140
00:08:00,656 --> 00:08:06,120
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

141
00:08:06,736 --> 00:08:10,120
♪Your freedom♪

142
00:08:10,176 --> 00:08:15,190
♪Has become my cage♪

143
00:08:15,744 --> 00:08:22,710
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

144
00:08:22,896 --> 00:08:28,260
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

145
00:08:29,056 --> 00:08:35,140
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

146
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:40,112
♪You told me♪

147
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:44,410
♪I would shine like a star♪

148
00:08:44,496 --> 00:08:48,200
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

149
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:52,570
♪How to live without you♪

150
00:08:53,030 --> 00:08:58,776
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

151
00:09:00,184 --> 00:09:03,280
♪So hazy and blurred♪
